    {
      "name": "screenshot",
      "description": "Open a URL or local dev server in a headless browser and capture a PNG so you can visually verify rendered output. Optionally wait for a selector, run click/type/wait actions, set the viewport, or capture the full page. Returns the image so you can see it. Requires the optional 'playwright' dependency and 'npx playwright install chromium'.",
